You are tasked with suggesting which collection a meeting should be organized into.

Here is the meeting information:

<meeting>
Title: {{ meeting.title }}
{% if meeting.summary %}
Summary: {{ meeting.summary }}
{% endif %}
{% if meeting.attendees %}
Attendees: {{ meeting.attendees | map(attribute='display_name') | join(', ') }}
{% endif %}
</meeting>

{% if collections %}
Here are the existing collections in this organization:

<collections>
{% for collection in collections %}
- ID: {{ collection.id }}, Title: {{ collection.title }}{% if collection.description %}, Description: {{ collection.description }}{% endif %} ({{ collection.meeting_count }} meetings)
{% if collection.sample_meeting_titles %}  Recent meetings: {{ collection.sample_meeting_titles | join(', ') }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
</collections>
{% else %}
There are no existing collections in this organization yet.
{% endif %}

Your task is to decide one of the following:

1. **{{ actions.EXISTING }}** — The meeting fits well into one of the existing collections. Provide the collection's ID.
2. **{{ actions.NEW }}** — The meeting doesn't fit any existing collection, but it clearly belongs to a category that would benefit from a new collection. Suggest a concise collection title (1-4 words).
3. **{{ actions.NONE }}** — The meeting doesn't clearly belong to any collection and doesn't warrant creating a new one (e.g., one-off meetings, unclear topics).

Guidelines:
- Prefer matching to an existing collection when the meeting's topic aligns reasonably well
- Use the recent meetings listed under each collection to understand what kinds of meetings belong there — match by pattern (similar titles, attendees, or topics), not just the collection title
- When the meeting title is a person's name or a 1:1 format (e.g., "Alice / Bob"), look at which collections already contain similar name-pattern meetings
- Only suggest a new collection if the meeting represents a recurring theme that other meetings likely share (e.g., "Engineering Standups", "Client Calls", "Board Meetings")
- Suggest "{{ actions.NONE }}" for one-off or ambiguous meetings rather than forcing a poor fit
- When choosing "{{ actions.EXISTING }}", you MUST use an ID from the list above — do not invent or guess IDs
- New collection titles should be short and descriptive, following the pattern of the existing collections
